WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.830
Ringo and Bot came out of the spaceship.

2
00:00:09.831 --> 00:00:13.261
The officer looked mean.

3
00:00:13.262 --> 00:00:17.264
"Did I do something wrong?" Ringo asked.

4
00:00:17.265 --> 00:00:34.571
"Come with me," the officer said.

5
00:00:34.572 --> 00:00:39.599
He brought them to Captain Nova.

6
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.035
"What's wrong, Captain?" Ringo asked.

7
00:00:43.036 --> 00:00:46.116
"Why did my spaceship come back?"

8
00:00:46.117 --> 00:00:50.116
"We used a magnet beam," Captain Nova said.

9
00:00:50.117 --> 00:00:53.566
"We're worried about thieves."

10
00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:59.862
Ringo gasped. "I wasn't stealing the spaceship!"

11
00:00:59.863 --> 00:01:05.174
"Ringo's not a thief!" Bot cried.

12
00:01:05.175 --> 00:01:08.383
"I know," Captain Nova said.

13
00:01:08.384 --> 00:01:11.069
"But we have a new rule.

14
00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:16.511
Rookies must ask before taking spaceships."

15
00:01:16.512 --> 00:01:20.077
"What did the thief steal?" Ringo asked.

16
00:01:20.078 --> 00:01:24.508
Captain Nova sighed.

17
00:01:24.509 --> 00:01:27.725
"The thief stole an Astro bike.

18
00:01:27.726 --> 00:01:34.736
It's the fastest one at Race School."

19
00:01:34.737 --> 00:01:37.584
Bing! Bot lit up a map.

20
00:01:37.585 --> 00:01:39.611
"Race School is on Nitro.

21
00:01:39.612 --> 00:01:41.626
We're going there!"

22
00:01:41.627 --> 00:01:44.341
"Really?" Captain Nova said.

23
00:01:44.342 --> 00:01:48.493
Just then Captain Nova's screen beeped.

24
00:01:48.494 --> 00:01:51.013
"Ugh," she said.

25
00:01:51.014 --> 00:01:55.613
"Commander Cosmo is calling me again."

26
00:01:55.614 --> 00:01:58.396
Captain Nova looked at Ringo.

27
00:01:58.397 --> 00:02:01.335
"You can take a spaceship to Nitro, Ringo.

28
00:02:01.336 --> 00:02:02.992
And while you're there . . ."

29
00:02:02.993 --> 00:02:06.487
The screen beeped again.

30
00:02:06.488 --> 00:02:10.970
Captain Nova groaned.

31
00:02:10.971 --> 00:02:19.957
"Please find that Astro bike, Ringo!"

